AI Assistant & Developer Rules — GreenLife (TechWiz 7)

[TechWiz 7 Compliance]
1. NO external database dependencies or server-side API requirements.
2. ALL data must be loaded asynchronously from local JSON assets (`assets/data/`).
3. App must be 100% custom-coded; NEVER use pre-built full-app templates.
4. AI feature MUST be simple, self-contained, and explainable in presentation.

[UI & Theme Guidelines]
5. Enforce Dark Mode UI (`#121212`) with off-white typography (`#F5F5F5`) and Green Accents (`#2ECC71`).
6. NEVER hardcode colors or inline string literals inside UI build methods.
7. Use touch-friendly padding and responsive widgets suitable for mobile/web.

[Code Quality & Execution]
8. Keep business logic outside Widget build trees using clean state controllers.
9. Ensure session-based state (e.g., Eco Score calculation) works smoothly without errors.
10. Code must compile with ZERO warnings on Chrome / Android targets.